---
import HotelList from "../components/practical-info/hotels/HotelList.astro";
import Hotel from "../components/practical-info/hotels/Hotel.astro";
import CommonLayout from "../layouts/CommonLayout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import OneColumn from "../components/OneColumn.astro";
---

<CommonLayout title="Hotels" header="Hotels" withLogo>
  <Hero title="Hotels" color="yellow" />
  <OneColumn>
    <div class="markdown">
      <p>
        Below are some hotel recommendations for your stay in Utrecht during RustWeek 2026.
      </p>
      <p>
        Prices shown are an indication only and are not kept up to date.
        Availability can change quickly; May is a popular holiday time.
        The prices include flexible cancellation, so lower (~ 20%) prices may be
        available for non-refundable options.
      </p>
    </div>
  </OneColumn>
  <HotelList>
    <Hotel
      name="Bunk Utrecht"
      link="https://wearebunk.com/utrecht/nl/"
      image="bunk.jpg"
      distance="15 min walk"
      price_range="€50 (shared) – €150 (private)">
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="2L De Blend"
      link="https://2ldeblend.nl/nl/"
      image="deblend.jpg"
      distance="10 min bus + 10 min walk"
      price_range="€150-175 (studio) – €200 (suite)">
    <p>
      Hotel with studios and suites with a fully equipped kitchen.
    </p>
    <p>
      Apply code <strong>'RustWeek2026'</strong> for a 20% discount on studios.
    </p>
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Park Plaza"
      link="https://www.parkplazautrecht.nl/"
      image="park-plaza.jpg"
      distance="10 min walk"
      price_range="€215">
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Moxy Utrecht"
      link="https://www.marriott.com/en-us/hotels/amsou-moxy-utrecht/overview/"
      image="moxy.avif"
      distance="3 min train + 10 min walk"
      price_range="€230">
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="NH Utrecht (Jaarbeursplein)"
      link="https://www.nh-hotels.com/nl/hotel/nh-utrecht"
      image="nh-utrecht.png"
      distance="5 min walk"
      price_range="€240">
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Hampton by Hilton"
      link="https://www.hilton.com/nl/hotels/amsunhx-hampton-utrecht-central-station/"
      image="hilton.jpeg"
      distance="10 min walk"
      price_range="€240">
    <p>
      Inside the Hoog Catharijne shopping mall, next to the Utrecht Centraal train station.
    </p>
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Crowne Plaza"
      link="https://www.ihg.com/crowneplaza/hotels/nl/nl/utrecht/utcur/hoteldetail/"
      image="crowne-plaza.jpeg"
      distance="10 min walk"
      price_range="€250">
    <p>
      Inside the Hoog Catharijne shopping mall, next to the Utrecht Centraal train station.
    </p>
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Inntel Hotel Utrecht"
      link="https://www.inntelhotelsutrechtcentre.nl/"
      image="inntel.jpg"
      distance="10 min walk"
      price_range="€275">
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Holiday Inn Express"
      link="https://www.ihg.com/holidayinnexpress/hotels/nl/nl/utrecht/amsut/hoteldetail"
      image="holiday-inn-express-utrecht.jpg"
      distance="10 min bus + 10 min walk"
      price_range="€150">
    <p>
      Slightly outside of Utrecht, at the A2 and A12 highways. Quick 10 min bus ride to the central station.
    </p>
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Van der Valk Utrecht"
      link="https://www.vandervalkhotelutrecht.nl/"
      image="vdv.jpg"
      distance="10 min tram + 10 min walk"
      price_range="€200">
    <p>
      Slightly outside of Utrecht, at the A12 highway; easy to reach by car.
    </p>
    </Hotel>
  </HotelList>

  <OneColumn>
    <div class="markdown">
      <h2 id="around-utrecht">Around Utrecht</h2>
      <p>
        If you can't find what you're looking for in Utrecht,
        consider staying in one of the surrounding cities.
        The <a href="/kinepolis/">conference venue</a> is just a short walk from the train station,
        Utrecht Centraal, which is very easy to reach by train from many places such as:
        Bunnik (8 minutes), Bilthoven (9 minutes), Houten (10 minutes), Amersfoort (13 minutes),
        Gouda (16 minutes), Hilversum (17 minutes), Amsterdam Zuid (22 minutes), and Schiphol Airport (33 minutes).
      </p>
    </div>
  </OneColumn>
  <HotelList>
    <Hotel
      name="Amrâth Hotel Media Park Hilversum"
      link="https://www.amrathhotelmediaparkhilversum.nl/"
      image="hilversum1.png"
      distance="40 min (train + walk)"
      price_range="€120">
    <p>
      Close to the Hilversum train station.
    </p>
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Mercure Hotel Amersfoort Centre"
      link="https://www.mercureamersfoort.nl/en"
      image="mercure-amersfoort.jpg"
      distance="31 min (train + walk)"
      price_range="€150">
    <p>
      Close to the Amersfoort train station.
    </p>
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Amrâth Hotel Lapershoek Arenapark"
      link="https://www.amrathhotellapershoekhilversum.nl/"
      image="hilversum-arenapark.png"
      distance="40 min (train + walk)"
      price_range="€150">
    <p>
      Close to the 'Hilversum Sportpark' train station.
    </p>
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Postillion Utrecht Bunnik"
      link="https://www.postillionhotels.com/utrecht/"
      image="postillion-bunnik.png"
      distance="34 min (train + walk)"
      price_range="€150">
    <p>
      Close to the Bunnik train station.
    </p>
    </Hotel>
    <Hotel
      name="Mercure Hotel Amersfoort Centre"
      link="https://www.mercureamersfoort.nl/en/"
      image="mercure-amersfoort.png"
      distance="40 min (train + walk)"
      price_range="~ €150">
    <p>
      Close to the Amersfoort train station.
    </p>
    </Hotel>
  </HotelList>
</CommonLayout>
